# An allowlist: only mcp/Dockerfile builds from here, and it needs exactly
# package*.json, .npmrc, src/ and mcp/. Anything else in a working copy (an
# EAS build's .ipa, a local replica) stays out without having to be named.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!.npmrc
!src
!mcp
**/node_modules
# A replica is a complete copy of someone's data.
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
